""Trans. Hold/Damage"", ""T"", ""Scrap"", ""S"", ""Liquidation"", ""L"", ""Return to
Vendor"", ""R"", ""Work In Progress"", ""W"", ""Q/A Hold"", ""Q"", ""Returns Hold"",
""H"", ""Customs Hold"", ""C"""
